+`chorelog add` appends an entry, dated today unless `--date` says otherwise. `chorelog report` prints how many entries each person has, most first; `--since YYYY-MM-DD` counts only entries dated on or after that day. The log is `chores.log` in the current directory; `--file` picks another.
 
